$ We want to select $2$ of those students for both the prizes, so we have $r=2.$ \n\nTherefore, the number of different ways to award the prizes is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{}_{7}{P}_{2} & =\\frac{7!}{(7-2)!} \\\\  & =\\frac{7!}{5!} \\\\  & =\\frac{7\\cdot 6\\cdot \\cancel{5!}}{\\cancel{5!}} \\\\  & =7\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =42.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243757 13194139533644 true] [17592186243756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243758 13194139533644 true] [17592186243756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243759 13194139533644 true] [17592186243756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243760 13194139533644 true] [17592186243756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243761 13194139533644 true] [17592186243756 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533644 true] [17592186243756 1041 "selection" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243756 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243760 13194139533644 true] [17592186243756 1110 #uuid "679a6f3d-b4f8-5429-9c9e-91dd72c829e7" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243757 1034 "28" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243757 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533644 true] [17592186243757 1111 #uuid "4b27b12b-bef1-55a2-a406-78b906bd5395" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243758 1034 "21" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243758 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533644 true] [17592186243758 1111 #uuid "6b2f5314-8c10-594e-a73e-ecb60654d83e" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243759 1034 "14" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243759 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533644 true] [17592186243759 1111 #uuid "f8738ba7-d816-58ea-8a50-14c291682adf" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243760 1034 "42" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243760 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533644 true] [17592186243760 1111 #uuid "067683bd-abbc-58a7-993f-6f3886778726" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243761 1034 "35" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243761 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533644 true] [17592186243761 1111 #uuid "3b8280b3-8cee-5144-8937-d97589f514e1" 13194139533644 true] [17592186243762 1017 #edb/ref 175